abstract: >-
  ACP is a protocol-first system for AI-assisted collective deliberation under
  bounded attention. This repository includes the ACP canonical protocol
  bundle, the Relay reference implementation, benchmark and evaluation
  harnesses, and a procedural skills layer with curated evidence artifacts.
keywords:
